{{#> layout title="Confirm your email address" preheader="One click confirms this address, so payments and account emails can reach you." reason=(concat "because it was given for a " appName " account")}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{userName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Press the button to confirm that <strong>{{recipient}}</strong> is your address. Buying credit needs a confirmed address.</p>
{{> button url=verificationUrl label="Confirm email address"}}
{{> fallback url=verificationUrl}}
{{#> note}}The link works once and lasts 24 hours. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email: the address stays unconfirmed.{{/note}}
{{/layout}}
